Different vocabularies. Totally different primitive objects to describe phenomena that mathematically are doing the exact same thing.

01:29.420 --> 01:34.200
They're just relaxing down gradients. We're circulating entropy and forming stable structures.

01:34.200 --> 01:42.400
And whenever a phenomenon crosses those arbitrary boundaries we've set up, we pay this massive cost in our understanding.

01:42.740 --> 01:45.380
We end up with these glaring blind spots.

01:45.540 --> 01:46.180
We really do.

