16:05.760 --> 16:06.060
No.

16:07.180 --> 16:08.400
The medium is the space.

16:08.440 --> 16:08.760
Whoa.

16:09.040 --> 16:11.740
The distances between things, the passage of time itself,

16:12.060 --> 16:14.260
