16:14.260 --> 16:17.920
The geometric relationships between the different properties of the fluid,

16:18.360 --> 16:20.700
its density, its flow, its entropy,

16:21.260 --> 16:24.960
those actually generate what we perceive as distance and duration.

16:25.320 --> 16:27.360
So it's not water flowing in a glass container.

