16:46.840 --> 16:51.600
acts mathematically identical to the curved spacetime of Einstein's relativity.

16:51.820 --> 16:52.140
Really?

16:52.820 --> 16:53.380
Identical?

16:53.480 --> 16:53.740
Yes.

16:54.260 --> 16:59.260
A sound wave trying to swim upstream against a fluid moving faster than the speed of sound gets trapped.

16:59.480 --> 16:59.720
Wow.

16:59.800 --> 17:02.860
It literally experiences a mathematical black hole horizon.

17:02.980 --> 17:03.580
Oh, wow.

