The sheer churning movement of the vector field, the velocity, generates new entropy.

21:10.240 --> 21:11.380
That makes intuitive sense.

21:11.540 --> 21:16.860
However, the diffusion of that entropy is actively suppressed by areas of high scalar potential.

21:17.120 --> 21:17.740
Hi-fi.

21:17.740 --> 21:18.220
Right.

