The paper explores this with a mathematical concept called Lamferdine smoothing.

22:08.020 --> 22:09.160
Lamferdine smoothing, okay.

22:09.580 --> 22:14.540
Lamferdine smoothing is the ultimate thermodynamic fate of this system, if left to its own devices.

22:14.540 --> 22:22.160
The author provides a rigorous mathematical proof for it, utilizing semi-group methods and Leopunov stability analysis.

22:22.380 --> 22:23.720
Okay, let's decode that real quick.

22:24.100 --> 22:29.320
Leopunov stability is a way of proving whether a dynamic system will eventually settle down into a resting state,

22:29.460 --> 22:32.680
or if it will wildly spiral out of control over time, right?

22:32.780 --> 22:33.220
Exactly.

22:33.480 --> 22:36.680
And the proof guarantees that in the absence of active sources,

22:37.240 --> 22:41.720
the entropy field will exponentially relax toward total perfect spatial uniformity.

22:41.980 --> 22:44.100
Meaning everything just blends together into gray?

