Yes.

22:45.220 --> 22:46.940
All the differences smooth out.

22:47.660 --> 22:49.300
The gradient decays to zero.

22:50.140 --> 22:58.200
The time it takes for this smoothing to happen mathematically defines the characteristic coarse-graining time of the medium itself.

22:58.540 --> 22:59.100
Wow.

22:59.180 --> 23:05.900
It reveals the universe's inherent natural tendency to flatten out to a uniform, quiet equilibrium.

23:06.580 --> 23:07.520
