They are made of the exact same stuff.

26:57.220 --> 27:01.540
They arise purely from different projection scales and admissibility constraints imposed

27:01.540 --> 27:04.720
on that exact same scalar vector entropy fluid.

27:05.060 --> 27:08.100
The key mechanism here is what physics calls core screening.

27:08.100 --> 27:12.980
And for anyone unfamiliar, core screening is essentially zooming out or pixelating the

27:12.980 --> 27:15.080
data so you can see the forest instead of the trees.

27:15.340 --> 27:15.760
Exactly.

27:16.040 --> 27:21.200
Imagine you take a high-resolution photograph of a golden retriever on your phone, and you

27:21.200 --> 27:23.140
hold the screen one inch from your eyeball.

27:23.720 --> 27:24.480
