27:29.460 --> 27:32.800
You are seeing the fundamental micro-level data.

27:32.920 --> 27:33.100
Right.

27:33.220 --> 27:33.840
The raw pixels.

27:33.840 --> 27:38.560
But if you hold the phone at arm's length, your brain coarse grains the image.

27:39.120 --> 27:44.780
It averages out the pixels, you lose the microscopic information, and suddenly a macroscopic pattern

27:44.780 --> 27:47.320
