27:47.500 --> 27:49.760
That is exactly what coarse graining is.

27:49.820 --> 27:49.940
Yeah.

27:49.980 --> 27:54.420
It's the deliberate discarding of micro-information to reveal macro-dynamics.

27:54.680 --> 27:54.900
Okay.

