Because the idea that gravity is an illusion is one of the coolest concepts in modern physics.

29:54.660 --> 29:57.120
It totally changes how you see things.

29:57.120 --> 30:02.660
If gravity isn't a magical, invisible tether pulling an apple to the earth, what is it?

