Any single person in that crowd might step left, right, forward, or backward.

30:44.140 --> 30:57.860
But because they are blocked by people behind them, and because the architecture of the stadium funnels open space toward the doors, the statistically overwhelming probability is that their random movements will result in a net displacement toward the exit.

30:57.860 --> 30:58.260
Yes.

30:58.380 --> 30:59.060
It's osmosis.

